<section class="py-5 bg-white" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center mb-5">
      <h2 id="how-heading" class="fw-bold fs-2 mb-2">How It Works</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">Six steps. One connected hospitality experience.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-sm-6 col-lg-4"><div class="d-flex gap-3 p-3 rounded-4 bg-light h-100"><div class="wl-step-num flex-shrink-0">1</div><div><div class="d-flex gap-2 mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass text-danger"></i><h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Discover</h6></div><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Browse 65+ verified properties across 12 categories with price, date, and type filters.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="col-sm-6 col-lg-4"><div class="d-flex gap-3 p-3 rounded-4 bg-light h-100"><div class="wl-step-num flex-shrink-0">2</div><div><div class="d-flex gap-2 mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check text-success"></i><h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Book</h6></div><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Reserve a room with real-time availability checks and server-verified pricing including GST.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="col-sm-6 col-lg-4"><div class="d-flex gap-3 p-3 rounded-4 bg-light h-100"><div class="wl-step-num flex-shrink-0">3</div><div><div class="d-flex gap-2 mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-check text-primary"></i><h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Prepare</h6></div><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Staff review upcoming arrivals and ensure rooms are operationally ready for check-in.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="col-sm-6 col-lg-4"><div class="d-flex gap-3 p-3 rounded-4 bg-light h-100"><div class="wl-step-num flex-shrink-0">4</div><div><div class="d-flex gap-2 mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-screwdriver-wrench text-warning"></i><h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Operate</h6></div><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Track and resolve service issues. Monitor in-house guests and pending departures.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="col-sm-6 col-lg-4"><div class="d-flex gap-3 p-3 rounded-4 bg-light h-100"><div class="wl-step-num flex-shrink-0">5</div><div><div class="d-flex gap-2 mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-info"></i><h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Ready</h6></div><p class="text-muted small mb-0">System dynamically confirms room guest-readiness once all open issues are resolved.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="col-sm-6 col-lg-4"><div class="d-flex gap-3 p-3 rounded-4 bg-light h-100"><div class="wl-step-num flex-shrink-0">6</div><div><div class="d-flex gap-2 mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-star text-danger"></i><h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Review</h6></div><p class="text-muted small mb-0">After checkout, guests leave verified reviews that help future travelers discover quality stays.</p></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wl-cta py-5 text-center" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="cta-heading" class="fw-bold fs-2 text-white mb-2">See WanderLust in Action</h2>
